-- Equal Opportunity Act 1984 (SA) -- worked cases for the complainant's questions (saeo-seat.l4) and the date helper
-- (saeo-dates.l4). Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text; none was copied from the encoding's
-- output. Each assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. The facts are illustrative.
